#* 상세 화면 — 기획서 6.2 "필드 사용처"

   참조를 카테고리별 트리로 보여주고, 각 항목에 해당 Jira 관리 화면 링크를 단다.
   기획서 결정 1: 여기서 지우지 않는다. 관리자를 표준 화면으로 데려다 준다. *#
#set ($field = $action.selectedField)
#set ($status = $field.status)
<html>
<head>
    <title>$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.title", $field.name)</title>
    <meta name="decorator" content="admin">
    <meta name="admin.active.section" content="admin_issues_menu/element_options_section/fields_section">
    <meta name="admin.active.tab" content="cf-usage-link">
    <style type="text/css">
        .janitor-summary { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px; margin: 12px 0 20px; }
        .janitor-summary dl { margin: 0; }
        .janitor-summary dt { color: #707070; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 2px; }
        .janitor-summary dd { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
        .janitor-verdict { margin: 0 0 20px; }
        .janitor-refgroup { margin-bottom: 24px; }
        /* 참조 표들과 떼어 놓는다. 위쪽은 "참조", 여기는 "문자열 일치"다. */
        .janitor-deep { margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 2px solid #dfe1e6; }
        .janitor-refgroup h3 { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .janitor-meta { color: #707070; font-size: 12px; }
        .janitor-cellnote { color: #6b778c; }
        .janitor-cellwarn { color: #974f0c; }
        .janitor-lang { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid #c1c7d0; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
        .janitor-lang a { padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 13px; text-decoration: none; color: #42526e; background: #fff; }
        .janitor-lang a:hover { background: #f4f5f7; text-decoration: none; }
        .janitor-lang a.janitor-lang-on { background: #0052cc; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; }
        .janitor-lang a + a { border-left: 1px solid #c1c7d0; }
        .janitor-chain { color: #505050; font-size: 12px; }
        .janitor-actions { margin: 20px 0; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
        .janitor-none { color: #707070; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="aui-page-header">
    <div class="aui-page-header-inner">
        <div class="aui-page-header-main">
            <h2>
                $action.text("janitor.fields.detail.heading")
                &mdash; $action.escape($field.name)
                <span class="janitor-meta">($field.fieldId)</span>
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="aui-page-header-actions">
            <div class="janitor-lang">
                <a href="$action.koUrl" #if($action.korean)class="janitor-lang-on"#end>한국어</a>
                <a href="$action.enUrl" #if(!$action.korean)class="janitor-lang-on"#end>English</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<p><a href="$action.selfUrl">&laquo; $action.text("janitor.fields.detail.backToList")</a></p>

<div class="janitor-summary">
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.column.status")</dt>
        <dd>
            #if ($status.lozengeType == "")
                <span class="aui-lozenge">$action.text($status.i18nKey)</span>
            #else
                <span class="aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-${status.lozengeType}">$action.text($status.i18nKey)</span>
            #end
        </dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.column.issuesWithValue")</dt>
        <dd>$field.issuesWithValue</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.column.valueRows")</dt>
        <dd>$field.valueRows</dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.column.lastChange")</dt>
        <dd>
            #if ($field.lastValueChangeAmbiguous)
                <span class="janitor-cellwarn">$action.text("janitor.fields.inaccurate")</span>
            #elseif ($field.lastValueChange)
                $action.formatDay($field.lastValueChange)
            #else
                <span class="janitor-cellnote">-</span>
            #end
        </dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.column.type")</dt>
        <dd>
            $action.escape($field.typeName)
            #if (!$field.typeAvailable)
                <div class="janitor-dup">$action.text("janitor.fields.typeUnavailableShort")</div>
            #end
        </dd>
    </dl>
    <dl>
        <dt>$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.context")</dt>
        <dd>
            #if ($field.globalContext)
                $action.text("janitor.fields.detail.contextGlobal")
            #elseif ($field.contextProjects.size() > 0)
                #foreach ($project in $field.contextProjects)$action.escape($project)#if($foreach.hasNext), #end#end
            #else
                <span class="janitor-cellnote">-</span>
            #end
            #if ($field.contextIssueTypes.size() > 0)
                <div class="janitor-meta">
                    #foreach ($issueType in $field.contextIssueTypes)$action.escape($issueType)#if($foreach.hasNext), #end#end
                </div>
            #end
        </dd>
    </dl>
</div>

#if ($field.duplicateName)
    <div class="aui-message aui-message-warning">
        <p>$action.text("janitor.fields.duplicateName")</p>
    </div>
#end

#if (!$field.typeAvailable)
    <div class="aui-message aui-message-warning">
        <p>$action.text("janitor.fields.typeUnavailable")</p>
    </div>
#end

<div class="aui-message #if($status.code == 'at-risk')aui-message-error#elseif($status.code == 'orphan-data')aui-message-warning#else aui-message-info#end janitor-verdict">
    <p>$action.text($field.verdictI18nKey)</p>
</div>

#if ($field.locked)
    <div class="aui-message aui-message-error">
        <p>$action.text("janitor.fields.locked")</p>
    </div>
#end

<div class="janitor-actions">
    <a class="aui-button" href="${action.contextPath}$field.configureUrl">$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.configure")</a>
    #* 잠긴 필드는 Jira 자신도 삭제 메뉴를 숨긴다. 링크를 두면 눌러도 안 되는 곳으로
       보내는 거짓말이 된다. *#
    #if (!$field.locked)
        <a class="aui-button" href="${action.contextPath}$field.deleteUrl">$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.deleteInJira")</a>
    #end
</div>

#macro (refgroup $typeName $type)
    #set ($refs = $field.getRefs($typeName))
    <div class="janitor-refgroup">
        <h3>$action.text($type.i18nKey) ($refs.size())</h3>
        #if ($refs.size() == 0)
            <p class="janitor-none">$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.noReference")</p>
        #else
            <table class="aui">
                <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.target")</th>
                    <th>$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.where")</th>
                    <th>$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.projects")</th>
                </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                #foreach ($ref in $refs)
                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            #if ($ref.adminUrl)
                                <a href="${action.contextPath}$ref.adminUrl">$action.escape($ref.targetName)</a>
                            #elseif ($ref.targetName)
                                $action.escape($ref.targetName)
                            #else
                                ## 대상 이름이 데이터에 없는 참조(예: 시스템 기본 컬럼).
                                ## 종류 문구를 대상 자리에 그린다 — 빈 칸은 수집 실패로 읽힌다.
                                $action.text($ref.detailI18nKey)
                            #end
                            #if ($ref.risky)
                                <span class="aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-error">$action.text("janitor.fields.detail.risky")</span>
                            #end
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            #if ($ref.detailI18nKey && $ref.targetName)
                                $action.text($ref.detailI18nKey)
                                #if ($ref.detail)<div class="janitor-meta">$action.escape($ref.detail)</div>#end
                            #elseif ($ref.detail)
                                $action.escape($ref.detail)
                            #else
                                <span class="janitor-cellnote">-</span>
                            #end
                        </td>
                        <td class="janitor-chain">
                            #if ($ref.projects.size() == 0)
                                <span class="janitor-cellnote">-</span>
                            #else
                                #foreach ($project in $ref.projects)
                                    <div>$action.escape($project)</div>
                                #end
                            #end
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                #end
                </tbody>
            </table>
        #end
    </div>
#end

#foreach ($type in $action.referenceTypes)
    #refgroup($type.name() $type)
#end

#* 심층 스캔 결과. 참조 그룹들과 <b>떨어뜨려</b> 둔다 — 성격이 다르기 때문이다.
   위쪽 표들은 "무엇이 이 필드를 참조한다"이고, 여기는 "어느 앱 테이블의 문자열에
   이 필드 ID가 들어 있다"까지다. 그 차이를 제목과 안내 문구가 계속 말해야 한다. *#
#if ($action.deepResultAvailable)
    <div class="janitor-refgroup janitor-deep">
        <h3>$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.title") ($action.deepMatchCount)</h3>
        <p class="janitor-meta">$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.caveat")</p>
        #if ($action.deepMatches.size() == 0)
            <p class="janitor-none">$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.none")</p>
        #else
            <table class="aui">
                <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.table")</th>
                    <th class="janitor-num">$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.count")</th>
                    <th>$action.text("janitor.fields.deep.detail.row")</th>
                </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                #foreach ($match in $action.deepMatches)
                    <tr>
                        <td>$action.escape($match.table)</td>
                        <td class="janitor-num">$match.matchCount</td>
                        <td>
                            #if ($match.sampleRowIds.size() == 0)
                                <span class="janitor-cellnote">-</span>
                            #else
                                #foreach ($rowId in $match.sampleRowIds)#if ($velocityCount > 1), #end$action.escape($rowId)#end
                                #if ($match.overflow > 0)<span class="janitor-cellnote"> +$match.overflow</span>#end
                            #end
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                #end
                </tbody>
            </table>
        #end
    </div>
#end

<div class="aui-message aui-message-info">
    <p>$action.text("janitor.fields.limitation")</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
